    /* ── Laptop layout (2026-10-12, Justin: "when viewing on my laptop its
       still geared more towards mobile vertical"). Phones and the 720px
       tablet column are untouched; everything below is >= 960px only.
       The console widens to a 1160px dashboard (the shared header lines its
       logo up with .wrap), the ride list goes two-up, one ride becomes main
       work on the left (requests, check-in, riders, seats) with the ride
       summary and Manage on the right, the chat becomes a wide conversation
       pane with the booking details beside it, and Wallet and Car & license
       sit as two columns. Sign-in and the other one-card states stay a
